title: Underground
subtitle: The party is banned. Keep it alive.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_mass
view-if: rf_underground_timer <= 0 and party_banned = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_underground_timer = 1

= Underground

The offices are sealed and the paper is banned. Members meet in flats and allotment huts.

- @cells: Rebuild the organisation cell by cell.
- @paper: Print an illegal Rote Fahne.

@cells
on-arrival: {!
Q.members += 6;
Q.apparatus += 3;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 2;
!}

Small groups meet in secret and keep paying dues. The organisation survives in a harder form.

@paper
on-arrival: {!
Q.members += 3;
Q.repression += 3;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 3;
!}

Illegal leaflets and papers circulate in the factories. The police seize some presses, but your faction's voice is the one members hear.
